  "title": "Red Hat Security Advisory: webkit2gtk3 security update",
  "description": "Multiple security vulnerabilities have been identified and fixed in the WebKitGTK port of the WebKit rendering engine, specifically in the ANGLE component used by chromium-browser. These include use-after-free, out-of-bounds read and write, buffer overflow, type confusion, uninitialized resource, and memory corruption issues. The update addresses these flaws in Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.4 variants.",
